To use DataTables with Semantic UI styling, you must load the Semantic UI integration files, not the default DataTables CSS.

Below is the correct, minimal, and safe setup that works with your existing MVC layout.


---

🎨 DataTables + Semantic UI (CORRECT WAY)

❌ What NOT to do

Do NOT use default DataTables CSS

Do NOT mix Bootstrap / default styles with Semantic UI



